{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useIsFetching(\n   host: ReactiveControllerHost,\n   filters?: Accessor<QueryFilters<readonly unknown[]>>,\n   queryClient?: QueryClient): IsFetchingAccessor;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/useIsFetching.ts#L141","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/lit-query/src/useIsFetching.ts:141"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Lit reactive controller that tracks how many matching queries are\ncurrently fetching."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filters"},{"type":"text","value":" is a function, it is re-read during host updates so the count\ncan follow reactive host state. If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient"},{"type":"text","value":" is omitted, the controller\nresolves the client from the nearest connected "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClientProvider"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"host","children":[{"type":"text","value":"host"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReactiveControllerHost"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Lit reactive controller host that owns the cache\nsubscription."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"filters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"filters?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/Accessor.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Accessor"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryFilters.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryFilters"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[]>> = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Query filters, or a getter that returns query filters."}]},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"filters-properties\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"filters-properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filters"},{"type":"text","value":" properties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built from "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryFilters.md#properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryFilters"}]},{"type":"text","value":". See the type above for what it changes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"queryclient","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queryClient?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../classes/QueryClient.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional explicit query client. Provide this for\ncontrollers that should not resolve a client from Lit context."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/IsFetchingAccessor.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IsFetchingAccessor"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An accessor for the current number of matching fetching queries."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { LitElement, html } from 'lit'\nimport { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/lit-query'\n\nclass TodosStatus extends LitElement {\n  private readonly todosFetching = useIsFetching(this, {\n    queryKey: ['todos'],\n  })\n\n  render() {\n    return html`<span>${this.todosFetching()} active todo fetches</span>`\n  }\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"host","text":"host","level":3},{"id":"filters","text":"filters?","level":3},{"id":"filters-properties","text":"filters properties","level":4},{"id":"queryclient","text":"queryClient?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useIsFetching(\n   host: ReactiveControllerHost,\n   filters?: Accessor<QueryFilters<readonly unknown[]>>,\n   queryClient?: QueryClient): IsFetchingAccessor;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/useIsFetching.ts:141](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/useIsFetching.ts#L141)\n\nCreates a Lit reactive controller that tracks how many matching queries are\ncurrently fetching.\n\nWhen `filters` is a function, it is re-read during host updates so the count\ncan follow reactive host state. If `queryClient` is omitted, the controller\nresolves the client from the nearest connected `QueryClientProvider`.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit reactive controller host that owns the cache\nsubscription.\n\n### filters?\n\n[`Accessor`](../type-aliases/Accessor.md)\\<[`QueryFilters`](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md)\\<readonly `unknown`[]\\>\\> = `{}`\n\nQuery filters, or a getter that returns query filters.\n\n<a id=\"filters-properties\"></a>\n\n#### `filters` properties\n\nBuilt from [`QueryFilters`](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md#properties). See the type above for what it changes.\n\n### queryClient?\n\n[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\n\nOptional explicit query client. Provide this for\ncontrollers that should not resolve a client from Lit context.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`IsFetchingAccessor`](../type-aliases/IsFetchingAccessor.md)\n\nAn accessor for the current number of matching fetching queries.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport { LitElement, html } from 'lit'\nimport { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/lit-query'\n\nclass TodosStatus extends LitElement {\n  private readonly todosFetching = useIsFetching(this, {\n    queryKey: ['todos'],\n  })\n\n  render() {\n    return html`<span>${this.todosFetching()} active todo fetches</span>`\n  }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useIsFetching\ntitle: useIsFetching\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useIsFetching(\n   host: ReactiveControllerHost,\n   filters?: Accessor<QueryFilters<readonly unknown[]>>,\n   queryClient?: QueryClient): IsFetchingAccessor;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/useIsFetching.ts:141](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/useIsFetching.ts#L141)\n\nCreates a Lit reactive controller that tracks how many matching queries are\ncurrently fetching.\n\nWhen `filters` is a function, it is re-read during host updates so the count\ncan follow reactive host state. If `queryClient` is omitted, the controller\nresolves the client from the nearest connected `QueryClientProvider`.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit reactive controller host that owns the cache\nsubscription.\n\n### filters?\n\n[`Accessor`](../type-aliases/Accessor.md)\\<[`QueryFilters`](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md)\\<readonly `unknown`[]\\>\\> = `{}`\n\nQuery filters, or a getter that returns query filters.\n\n<a id=\"filters-properties\"></a>\n\n#### `filters` properties\n\nBuilt from [`QueryFilters`](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md#properties). See the type above for what it changes.\n\n### queryClient?\n\n[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\n\nOptional explicit query client. Provide this for\ncontrollers that should not resolve a client from Lit context.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`IsFetchingAccessor`](../type-aliases/IsFetchingAccessor.md)\n\nAn accessor for the current number of matching fetching queries.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport { LitElement, html } from 'lit'\nimport { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/lit-query'\n\nclass TodosStatus extends LitElement {\n  private readonly todosFetching = useIsFetching(this, {\n    queryKey: ['todos'],\n  })\n\n  render() {\n    return html`<span>${this.todosFetching()} active todo fetches</span>`\n  }\n}\n```\n"}
